[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H[SNAKE]                                                  │ [CONFIG]\n. Snake-Modus aktiv (running).                           │ . Snake-Modus aktiv  running\n. Ctrl+X markiert Start/Ende.                            │ . Snake-ID: s1 · Peers: 1\n. Ctrl+E Chat-Fokus; Ctrl+U Auto-Heuristik.              │ . Ctrl+X=Markieren, Ctrl+V=Replace, Ctrl+E=Chat\n. Ctrl+O mouse-follow; Klick bestaetigt Ziel, Scroll ... │ . Ctrl+O=MouseFollow, Klick=Intent+Chat, Scroll=Intent-Hin...\n. Freigaben: :snake-access <id> cancel|view|full         │ . Snakes (OIDC / Farbe / Nachricht):\n. S1 local-snake [mint] access=full @local               │ . \u001b[38;2;170;255;210mS1 local-snake@local [mint]\u001b[0m: \u001b[38;2;96;215;165m[mouse-follow] user start\u001b[0m\n. S-AI tutor-ai [amber] access=view @lmstudio-ai         │ . \u001b[38;2;255;205;130mS-AI tutor-ai@lmstudio-ai [amber]\u001b[0m: \u001b[38;2;224;155;84m[heuristic:snake_tui_...\u001b[0m\n------------------------------------------------------- [HEADER] ------------\u001b[38;2;224;155;84m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;224;155;84m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;224;155;84m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;255;205;130m●\u001b[0m------\u001b[38;2;96;215;165m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;96;215;165m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;96;215;165m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;170;255;210m●\u001b[0m-----------------------------\n NAV                   |  DASHBOARD                                                 |  AI-SNAKE                         \n>  Dashboard           |   System                                                   |   tutor-ai overview               \n . Goals               |     Agents  2/2 online                                     |   score:0 best:0 spd:3/5          \n . Tasks               |     Queue   1 tasks pending                                |   llm:lokal                       \n . Artifacts           |                                                            |   ------------------------------  \n . Knowledge           |   Overview                                                 |   Ctrl+U Heuristik:AN             \n . Config              |     Goals:  1 active goal                                  |   Ctrl+E Chat-Fokus               \n . Templates           |     Tasks:  2 running tasks                                |   Ctrl+I Status kopieren          \n . System              |                                                            |                                   \n . Audit               |                                                            |                                   \n . Terminal            |                                                            |                                   \n . Share / Teilnehmer  |                                                            |  CHAT                             \n . Help                |                                                            |   ACTIVE: #room                   \n                       |                                                            |   [#room] AI notes                \n                       |                                                            |   ------------------------------  \n                       |                                                            |   keine Nachrichten               \n                       |                                                            |   ------------------------------  \n                       |                                                            |   Ctrl+E Eingabe  Ctrl+W Kanal    \n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nendpoint=http://localhost:1234 auth=unknown focus=header mode=normal [heuristic:snake_tui_follow_distance_default] [m...\n \n[Ctrl+S] Snake  [Ctrl+G] Chat  [Ctrl+E] Input  [Ctrl+P] Pause  [Ctrl+U] Tutorial-AI  [Ctrl+A] AI-Config  [Ctrl+\\/Ctrl...\n"]
